{"ticker":"RL","updated":"2026-10-23T23:57:57Z","profile":{"longName":"Ralph Lauren Corporation","shortName":"Ralph Lauren Corporation","sector":"Consumer Cyclical","industry":"Apparel Manufacturing","country":"United States","website":"https://www.ralphlauren.com","fullTimeEmployees":15600,"marketCap":22486337536,"trailingPE":23.780718,"forwardPE":18.118204,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":2.6912985,"pegRatio":2.05,"targetMeanPrice":446.1875,"targetHighPrice":520.0,"targetLowPrice":250.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":16,"recommendationKey":"buy","revenueGrowth":0.14,"earningsGrowth":0.216,"grossMargins":0.70268995,"operatingMargins":0.18395,"profitMargins":0.117639996,"totalRevenue":8355200000,"beta":1.355,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":421.6,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":306.55,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NYQ","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":1.05},"summary":"Ralph Lauren Corporation designs, markets, and distributes lifestyle products in North America, Europe, Asia, and internationally. The company offers apparel, including a range of men's, women's, and children's clothing; footwear and accessories, which comprise casual shoes, dress shoes, boots, sneakers, sandals, eyewear, watches, fashion and fine jewelry, scarves, hats, gloves, and umbrellas, as well as leather goods comprising handbags, luggage, small leather goods, and belts; home products, such as bed and bath lines, furniture, fabric and wall coverings, lighting, dining, floor coverings, decorative accessories, and giftware; and fragrances. The company sells apparel and accessories under the Ralph Lauren Collection, Ralph Lauren Purple Label, Polo Ralph Lauren, Double RL, Lauren Ralph Lauren, RLX Ralph Lauren, Polo Ralph Lauren Children, and Chaps brands; women's fragrances under the Ralph Lauren Collection, Woman by Ralph Lauren, Romance Collection, and Ralph Collection brand names; and men's fragrances under the Ralph's Club, Purple Label, Polo Blue, Polo Red, Polo Green, Polo Black, Polo 67, Safari, Polo Sport, and Big Pony Men's brand names. Its restaurant collection includes The Polo Bar in New York City; RL Restaurant in Chicago; Ralph's in Paris; The Bar at Ralph Lauren located in Milan; Ralph's Bar located in Chengdu, China; and Ralph's Coffee concept. The company ","summary_zh":"Ralph Lauren Corporation 在北美、歐洲、亞洲和國際上設計、行銷和分銷生活方式產品。該公司提供服裝，包括一系列男裝、女裝和童裝；鞋類和配飾，包括休閒鞋、正裝鞋、靴子、運動鞋、涼鞋、眼鏡、手錶、時裝和高級珠寶、圍巾、帽子、手套和雨傘，以及皮革製品，包括手袋、行李箱、小皮革製品和皮帶；家居產品，例如床具和浴室系列、家具、餐飲和牆壁。該公司銷售 Ralph Lauren Collection、Ralph Lauren Purple Label、Polo Ralph Lauren、Double RL、Lauren Ralph Lauren、RLX Ralph Lauren、Polo Ralph Lauren Children 和 Chaps 品牌的服裝和配件； Ralph Lauren Collection、Woman by Ralph Lauren、Romance Collection 和 Ralph Collection Ralph 品牌的香水； Black、Polo 67、Safari、Polo Sport 和 Big Pony Men's 品牌的男士香水。其旗下餐廳包括紐約市的 The Polo Bar；芝加哥 RL 餐廳；拉爾夫在巴黎；位於米蘭的 Ralph Lauren 酒吧； Ralph's Bar 位於中國成都；和拉爾夫的咖啡概念。公司","sector_zh":"週期性消費","industry_zh":"服裝製造","candles":[{"t":"2025-08-25","o":286.11,"h":291.09,"l":286.11,"c":287.39,"v":449900},{"t":"2025-08-26","o":288.59,"h":293.78,"l":287.03,"c":293.2,"v":595700},{"t":"2025-08-27","o":296.57,"h":297.6,"l":292.6,"c":294.64,"v":613200},{"t":"2025-08-28","o":296.52,"h":299.95,"l":295.9,"c":297.64,"v":443800},{"t":"2025-08-29","o":297.15,"h":298.87,"l":295.38,"c":296.93,"v":578800},{"t":"2025-09-02","o":293.25,"h":311.45,"l":292.9,"c":311.02,"v":827800},{"t":"2025-09-03","o":310.13,"h":317.34,"l":310.1,"c":313.36,"v":514800},{"t":"2025-09-04","o":312.6,"h":321.5,"l":312.6,"c":320.75,"v":566900},{"t":"2025-09-05","o":321.17,"h":321.77,"l":309.92,"c":312.02,"v":628700},{"t":"2025-09-08","o":315.03,"h":319.0,"l":307.06,"c":308.99,"v":615000},{"t":"2025-09-09","o":308.97,"h":310.07,"l":304.04,"c":309.79,"v":490600},{"t":"2025-09-10","o":311.17,"h":315.19,"l":308.52,"c":312.58,"v":630100},{"t":"2025-09-11","o":315.06,"h":316.58,"l":311.96,"c":316.35,"v":581500},{"t":"2025-09-12","o":314.79,"h":317.72,"l":312.06,"c":315.14,"v":518100},{"t":"2025-09-15","o":314.6,"h":318.8,"l":313.55,"c":315.77,"v"